WEBVTT

1
00:00:01.000 --> 00:00:05.687
One request on T57. Verified quotes, side by side.

2
00:00:05.887 --> 00:00:10.461
Say what you need: Sukkari dates, twenty tonnes, delivered to Jeddah.

3
00:00:10.661 --> 00:00:13.108
It goes only to verified suppliers.

4
00:00:13.308 --> 00:00:17.005
Sort the quotes by price, delivery time and record score.

5
00:00:17.205 --> 00:00:20.648
Accept the best one, and the invoice is drawn from the quote.

6
00:00:20.848 --> 00:00:23.341
T57. Post a request.
